  "source_url": "https://rinpharma.github.io/data-pipelines/output/processed_talks.csv",
  "abstract": "Amgen, a leading biotech company has built a web of connected data to help employees better understand the pharma products our company makes as well as who they can reach out to when they have questions (Experience Locator). This session will share the engineering architecture that brings diverse internal data sources together for an intuitive user experience that we've created using R Shiny.",
